# FIDO2 keys that are sign-only / no-touch (the per-role agent identities). These keys:
#   - are excluded from the interactive ssh-agent by `ssh-load-keys`
#   - are each loaded (ONE per role) into an ephemeral agent for a dca / --agent container
# Only hashes are stored here, never the key name (recompute to identify). One hex digest
# per line; `#`/blank lines are ignored, but NO inline comments on a hash line (the match
# is whole-line). Add a key:  printf '%s' '<app-suffix>' | sha256sum   (suffix = application
# without the `ssh:` prefix, e.g. ssh:implementer -> implementer).
